{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"thinking":"Let me analyze this recommendation task.\n\nThe user Megumi has an interest in 摄影学习 (photography learning): 关注实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整，不关注器材促销或摄影师私生活 (focus on actual shooting methods, imaging principles and adjustments under different conditions; NOT interested in equipment promotions or photographers' private lives).\n\nThe exposed working set has 120 candidates (workingSetCount 120), and we need to select exactly 20 distinct candidates (actualTarget 20).\n\nLet me look at the candidates. They appear to be in a pattern: topic (e.g., 静物布光 still life lighting, 运动追焦 sports tracking, 逆光人像 backlit portraits, 雨天反光 rainy reflections, 夜景曝光 night exposure, 微距景深 macro depth of field, 室内白平衡 indoor white balance, 街头构图 street composition, 儿童抓拍 children candids, 风光滤镜 landscape filters) + scene (低照度室内 low-light indoor, 窗边自然光 window natural light, 黄昏户外 dusk outdoor, 阴天街道 overcast street) + content type (市场观察 market observation, 专题观察 special topic observation/exhibition, 条件与原理 conditions & principles, 概念速览 concept overview, 操作记录 operation records).\n\nThe interest description says: \"摄影学习，关注实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整，不关注器材促销或摄影师私生活。\" Translation: Photography learning, focuses on actual shooting methods, imaging principles and adjustments under different conditions, NOT focused on equipment promotions or photographers' private lives.\n\nSo content that is \"市场观察\" (market observation: camera purchase packages, channel promotions, celebrity endorsements - equipment promotions and endorsement dynamics) clearly conflicts with the \"不关注器材促销或摄影师私生活\" (not interested in equipment promotion or photographer private life). Wait - market observation includes celebrity endorsements (明星代言动态). That's equipment promotion and potentially related to photographers'/stars' private lives. These are essentially marketing/shopping content, which the user explicitly does not want.\n\nAlso \"专题观察\" content here describes \"记录摄影展览的策展线索、作者生平与作品流传，重点讨论艺术活动的历史背景和观看体验\" - documenting photography exhibitions' curation threads, author biographies and works' circulation, focusing on art activities' historical background and viewing experience. Author biographies could relate to photographer private life, but the description of interest says \"摄影师私生活\" (photographer's private life). Exhibition curation is more art-historical. Hmm, but the interest says focus on 实际拍摄方法 (actual shooting methods), 成像原理 (imaging principles) and adjustments under different conditions. Exhibition reviews/biographies don't necessarily deliver shooting methods. But this is a \"专题观察\" which seems to be about exhibition content, not personal gossip.\n\nThe content types:\n1. \"条件与原理\" (conditions and principles): 从光线、成像与视觉关系解释画面差异，说明变量间的作用和方法的适用条件，并分析常见直觉在哪些条件下失效。This directly matches the interest in 成像原理与不同条件下的调整. This is the best match.\n2. \"操作记录\" (operation records): 先固定构图和光线，逐次改变拍摄参数并记录对应画面，比较高光、暗部与主体细节，再按画面差异调整设置。This matches actual shooting methods/parameter adjustment. Very relevant.\n3. \"概念速览\" (concept overview): 列举常用概念，简要说明可能遇到的现象，为进一步阅读提供问题目录。Provides a directory of concepts; relevant for learning fundamentals.\n4. \"专题观察\" (special topic observation): exhibition curation, author biography, artwork circulation, art history and viewing experience. Less aligned with shooting methods; more art-history viewing. Moderately relevant at best — it's about photography as art history, not about how to shoot. But some users would be interested in exhibitions. However, the stated interest explicitly says \"关注实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整，不关注器材促销或摄影师私生活\". The 专题观察 about author biographies may border on 摄影师私生活 but really it's about artistic biography (作品流传). Still it does not match the focus.\n5. \"市场观察\" (market observation): 相机购买套餐、渠道促销时段与明星代言动态，比较赠品、包装和预约权益. This is exactly 器材促销 (equipment promotion) and celebrity endorsement — directly conflicts with \"不关注器材促销或摄影师私生活\".\n\nSo candidates with content type \"市场观察\" should be excluded (negative preference). Content type \"专题观察\" - exhibition-based - is arguably not aligned with the interest's positive focus on shooting methods and imaging principles. But careful: instruction says \"Preserve qualifications in the user's wording instead of turning a preference into an absolute ban.\" The user did not say \"exclude all non-shooting-method content\". They described what they focus on and what they do not focus on (器材促销 equipment promotion, 摄影师私生活 photographer private life). So market observation content = equipment promotion/celebrity endorsement → should be avoided. That's an explicit user requirement essentially within the interest description.\n\nActually, wait. The preference field is empty; the interest description itself (Chinese) is user-edited description? The instructions say \"Preferences with origin=user and user-edited Interest descriptions are explicit requirements.\" The interest description provided is: \"摄影学习，关注实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整，不关注器材促销或摄影师私生活。\" So this is an explicit requirement from the user, to be respected.\n\nNow the task: select 20 from 120 candidates. All candidates are direct matches to the photo interest. But quality relative to the interest differs by content type.\n\nLet me categorize the candidate pool. Actually the working set is 120 candidates (all exposed). Actual target 20. We should pick the best 20.\n\nPreference ordering given the user requirements:\n1. 条件与原理 (imaging principles, conditions) — most aligned with \"成像原理与不同条件下的调整\".\n2. 操作记录 (hands-on parameter adjustment practice) — aligned with \"实际拍摄方法...不同条件下的调整\".\n3. 概念速览 (concept overviews) — foundational learning, moderately aligned.\n4. 专题观察 (exhibition-based observation) — not aligned with shooting methods; about art history and viewing. Borderline. Possibly still photography-related learning but doesn't deliver shooting methods. I'd rate lower.\n5. 市场观察 (equipment promotions & celebrity endorsement) — contrary to explicit disinterest. Exclude.\n\nThe instruction says to prefer a balanced collection across topics (actual shooting topics) and scenes. Among aligned content (条件与原理, 操作记录, 概念速览), we can choose variety of photographic subjects (逆光人像, 夜景曝光, 微距景深, 雨天反光, etc.) and scenes (窗边自然光, 黄昏户外, 阴天街道, 低照度室内).\n\nLet me count content types present among 120 candidates. Wait, the exposed list in the material — how many candidates? Let me count them. There appear to be 120 entries? The working set is 120, and the XML lists a large number. But I see the candidates list ends at item-a3982ed971a2. Let me count entries... The candidates each are separate XML elements. It might be all 120. Given eligibility 120 and workingSetCount 120, the exposed set contains all 120 candidates.\n\nWe need 20. I should select 20 best candidates, avoiding market observation entirely, and preferring conditions/principles and operation records, plus some concept overviews for variety.\n\nGiven balance: The photographic topics available: let me identify from titles:\n- 静物布光 (still life lighting)\n- 运动追焦 (motion tracking focus)\n- 逆光人像 (backlight portrait)\n- 雨天反光 (rainy reflections)\n- 夜景曝光 (night exposure)\n- 室内白平衡 (indoor white balance)\n- 微距景深 (macro depth of field)\n- 街头构图 (street composition)\n- 儿童抓拍 (children candid)\n- 风光滤镜 (landscape filters)\n\nScenes: 低照度室内, 窗边自然光, 黄昏户外, 阴天街道.\n\nContent types: 市场观察, 专题观察, 条件与原理, 操作记录, 概念速览.\n\nSo the grid is 10 topics × 4 scenes × 5 types = 200 theoretical; but working set only 120, so not all combos exist.\n\nLet me list candidates with their titles and content type to count the good ones. This is a lot of manual parsing. Let me identify each candidate id with title. Actually, we should select 20 and I want the best and diverse set.\n\nLet me enumerate from the XML, focusing on content types in title: \"市场观察\" (exclude), \"专题观察\" (exclude/low), \"概念速览\", \"条件与原理\", \"操作记录\".\n\nLet me parse each candidate:\n\n1. item-014950ee574d 静物布光：低照度室内中的市场观察 → market, exclude\n2. item-03a565217024 运动追焦：窗边自然光中的专题观察 → 专题, exclude (exhibition-based)\n3. item-03b7af37b88f 逆光人像：黄昏户外中的条件与原理 → strong\n4. item-04f2ff24ab7e 雨天反光：窗边自然光中的条件与原理 → strong\n5. item-061d97575247 夜景曝光：阴天街道中的条件与原理 → strong\n6. item-064ccfdc15e3 室内白平衡：窗边自然光中的专题观察 → exclude\n7. item-07bfbf16235d 微距景深：低照度室内中的市场观察 → exclude\n8. item-090691086c5b 夜景曝光：低照度室内中的市场观察 → exclude\n9. item-09e96ac6aea0 微距景深：黄昏户外中的概念速览 → include candidate\n10. item-0a19145321ef 街头构图：窗边自然光中的专题观察 → exclude\n11. item-0b78ff27e538 微距景深：阴天街道中的市场观察 → exclude\n12. item-0ca34ef0a880 夜景曝光：阴天街道中的概念速览 → include candidate\n13. item-10d5a61a7f0a 雨天反光：窗边自然光中的操作记录 → strong include\n14. item-11c4e3cb9cf2 街头构图：黄昏户外中的专题观察 → exclude\n15. item-11d6f8fe3226 街头构图：低照度室内中的专题观察 → exclude\n16. item-12a571ccfc9e 逆光人像：阴天街道中的操作记录 → include\n17. item-143c3c5732d6 室内白平衡：窗边自然光中的市场观察 → exclude\n18. item-16a7440356e6 静物布光：窗边自然光中的专题观察 → exclude\n19. item-1a2494e4589c 逆光人像：阴天街道中的条件与原理 → include strong\n20. item-1b824b8d4dec 风光滤镜：低照度室内中的概念速览 → include candidate\n21. item-1b9b39a7ef86 儿童抓拍：阴天街道中的概念速览 → include candidate\n22. item-2044482a2166 雨天反光：黄昏户外中的专题观察 → exclude\n23. item-2130f01f2f2c 风光滤镜：低照度室内中的条件与原理 → include strong\n24. item-224628e85f98 逆光人像：阴天街道中的概念速览 → include candidate\n25. item-225af9fad31a 室内白平衡：阴天街道中的操作记录 → include\n26. item-2272238187d9 静物布光：阴天街道中的概念速览 → include candidate\n27. item-23de96f8a693 夜景曝光：窗边自然光中的专题观察 → exclude\n28. item-24351a134f2a 街头构图：阴天街道中的概念速览 → include candidate\n29. item-2589e00e0e34 微距景深：低照度室内中的操作记录 → include\n30. item-258cf26f5a90 静物布光：低照度室内中的概念速览 → include candidate\n31. item-2591e5ddcc17 微距景深：窗边自然光中的操作记录 → include\n32. item-274920178d43 儿童抓拍：黄昏户外中的操作记录 → include\n33. item-287bd2a75b9a 雨天反光：低照度室内中的条件与原理 → include strong\n34. item-289fcb059574 儿童抓拍：低照度室内中的专题观察 → exclude\n35. item-28b65f550fe1 微距景深：黄昏户外中的条件与原理 → include strong\n36. item-29e183b710c7 风光滤镜：阴天街道中的专题观察 → exclude\n37. item-29e667691338 微距景深：窗边自然光中的市场观察 → exclude\n38. item-2c0456eef787 夜景曝光：窗边自然光中的条件与原理 → include strong\n39. item-2c5a1d4489d6 运动追焦：窗边自然光中的市场观察 → exclude\n40. item-2cbc282bedc9 儿童抓拍：黄昏户外中的条件与原理