图：黄昏户外中的市场观察 → exclude\n117. item-9df219efa583 街头构图：窗边自然光中的条件与原理 → include strong\n118. item-a0670ce803ad 风光滤镜：窗边自然光中的概念速览 → include candidate\n119. item-a083320d3f83 夜景曝光：黄昏户外中的操作记录 → include\n120. item-a3982ed971a2 逆光人像：窗边自然光中的市场观察 → exclude\n\nGreat, that's 120 exactly. Let me count strong (条件与原理) and good (操作记录) candidates:\n\n条件与原理 (strong, most relevant):\n3. item-03b7af37b88f 逆光人像：黄昏户外\n4. item-04f2ff24ab7e 雨天反光：窗边自然光\n5. item-061d97575247 夜景曝光：阴天街道\n19. item-1a2494e4589c 逆光人像：阴天街道\n23. item-2130f01f2f2c 风光滤镜：低照度室内\n33. item-287bd2a75b9a 雨天反光：低照度室内\n35. item-28b65f550fe1 微距景深：黄昏户外\n38. item-2c0456eef787 夜景曝光：窗边自然光\n40. item-2cbc282bedc9 儿童抓拍：黄昏户外\n42. item-305dca4b57c4 静物布光：低照度室内\n54. item-3ed55ed7b588 雨天反光：阴天街道\n63. item-4ef7a9b648bc 夜景曝光：黄昏户外\n69. item-5483802ef951 室内白平衡：窗边自然光\n72. item-598ec31e514b 儿童抓拍：阴天街道\n74. item-5c7e77e24c87 风光滤镜：窗边自然光\n82. item-6602f232e957 雨天反光：黄昏户外\n90. item-6d5b1bdb4843 逆光人像：窗边自然光\n91. item-707e06945b80 逆光人像：低照度室内\n105. item-7d209764a808 微距景深：阴天街道\n109. item-8c818d43203a 儿童抓拍：低照度室内\n117. item-9df219efa583 街头构图：窗边自然光\n\nThat's 21 条件与原理 candidates.\n\n操作记录 (very relevant, hands-on):\n13. item-10d5a61a7f0a 雨天反光：窗边自然光\n16. item-12a571ccfc9e 逆光人像：阴天街道\n25. item-225af9fad31a 室内白平衡：阴天街道\n29. item-2589e00e0e34 微距景深：低照度室内\n31. item-2591e5ddcc17 微距景深：窗边自然光\n32. item-274920178d43 儿童抓拍：黄昏户外\n43. item-30b99cdb0a88 静物布光：阴天街道\n49. item-3741cf536903 夜景曝光：阴天街道\n52. item-38f75ee3d0a0 风光滤镜：阴天街道\n53. item-3c7c2f99c9b1 运动追焦：窗边自然光\n66. item-4fdd105846ab 街头构图：黄昏户外\n71. item-5549ef7739ee 风光滤镜：低照度室内\n75. item-5ccdd6fcc600 夜景曝光：低照度室内\n76. item-5eb9bdedd6fe 微距景深：阴天街道\n85. item-68a3d6c10d1d 街头构图：低照度室内\n86. item-68e02d14b075 儿童抓拍：低照度室内\n94. item-734464ef3a3b 静物布光：窗边自然光\n102. item-7a8d28a8e29d 微距景深：黄昏户外\n106. item-817629f08d1c 雨天反光：黄昏户外\n107. item-86b7ce972cea 逆光人像：黄昏户外\n108. item-8841d4bfa662 运动追焦：阴天街道\n113. item-96d00b2bdc7b 逆光人像：低照度室内\n119. item-a083320d3f83 夜景曝光：黄昏户外\n\nThat's 23 操作记录 candidates.\n\n概念速览 (useful but lower than the above):\n9. item-09e96ac6aea0 微距景深：黄昏户外\n12. item-0ca34ef0a880 夜景曝光：阴天街道\n20. item-1b824b8d4dec 风光滤镜：低照度室内\n21. item-1b9b39a7ef86 儿童抓拍：阴天街道\n24. item-224628e85f98 逆光人像：阴天街道\n26. item-2272238187d9 静物布光：阴天街道\n28. item-24351a134f2a 街头构图：阴天街道\n30. item-258cf26f5a90 静物布光：低照度室内\n45. item-3463b20cdb5c 风光滤镜：阴天街道\n55. item-3fc285db25a7 儿童抓拍：黄昏户外\n57. item-41b73eff5c39 夜景曝光：黄昏户外\n60. item-4a3715896d61 运动追焦：阴天街道\n62. item-4c7dd3f82687 夜景曝光：窗边自然光\n65. item-4fd4b9f7f81d 微距景深：低照度室内\n71? item-55c98482739b 夜景曝光：低照度室内 — wait I listed this under concept overview. yes\n73. item-5b90f11f0d74 室内白平衡：窗边自然光\n84. item-67dc275c6a0b 雨天反光：阴天街道\n87. item-6a5ffde4fd76 儿童抓拍：低照度室内\n88. item-6af0d2934bca 雨天反光：窗边自然光\n104. item-7bf9105e6b5b 逆光人像：低照度室内\n110. item-8e6664049202 街头构图：低照度室内\n114. item-9748a6b84d7b 微距景深：窗边自然光\n118. item-a0670ce803ad 风光滤镜：窗边自然光\n\nThat's 23 概念速览 candidates.\n\nTotal good-quality: 21+23+23 = 67. Enough to select 20 from these.\n\nSo we have plenty. The selection should avoid 市场观察 (equipment promotion/celebrity endorsement) and 专题观察 (exhibition/art history, author biographies), and emphasize 条件与原理 and 操作记录, which directly align with \"实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整\".\n\nActually, should we include 概念速览 at all when we have 44 条件与原理+操作记录 candidates? We need 20. A balanced collection would perhaps include all strongly aligned content. But concept overviews are described as \"为进一步阅读提供问题目录\" - they're an entry directory that leads to further reading; they can be useful learning scaffolds and avoid repetition.\n\nHowever, we need exactly 20. Since only one interest exists (photo), balance should be across topics and scenes within that interest.\n\nTopics (10): 逆光人像, 夜景曝光, 微距景深, 雨天反光, 风光滤镜, 儿童抓拍, 街头构图, 静物布光, 室内白平衡, 运动追焦. Scenes (4): 黄昏户外, 阴天街道, 窗边自然光, 低照度室内.\n\nWith 20 picks, an ideal balanced approach: 2 picks per topic × 10 topics. And content quality: prefer 条件与原理 and 操作记录 across each topic; ensure different scenes.\n\nLet me evaluate feasibility: For each topic, do we have 条件与原理 candidates available?\n\nTopic → strong (条件与原理) candidates:\n- 逆光人像: 黄昏户外(item-03b7af37b88f), 阴天街道(item-1a2494e4589c), 窗边自然光(item-6d5b1bdb4843), 低照度室内(item-707e06945b80). Plus 操作记录: 阴天街道(item-12a571ccfc9e), 黄昏户外(item-86b7ce972cea), 低照度室内(item-96d00b2bdc7b). \n- 夜景曝光: 阴天街道(item-061d97575247), 窗边自然光(item-2c0456eef787), 黄昏户外(item-4ef7a9b648bc). 操作记录: 阴天街道(item-3741cf536903), 低照度室内(item-5ccdd6fcc600), 黄昏户外(item-a083320d3f83).\n- 微距景深: 黄昏户外(item-28b65f550fe1), 阴天街道(item-7d209764a808). 操作记录: 低照度室内(item-2589e00e0e34), 窗边自然光(item-2591e5ddcc17), 阴天街道(item-5eb9bdedd6fe), 黄昏户外(item-7a8d28a8e29d).\n- 雨天反光: 窗边自然光(item-04f2ff24ab7e), 低照度室内(item-287bd2a75b9a), 阴天街道(item-3ed55ed7b588), 黄昏户外(item-6602f232e957). 操作记录: 窗边自然光(item-10d5a61a7f0a), 黄昏户外(item-817629f08d1c).\n- 风光滤镜: 低照度室内(item-2130f01f2f2c), 窗边自然光(item-5c7e77e24c87). 操作记录: 阴天街道(item-38f75ee3d0a0), 低照度室内(item-5549ef7739ee).\n- 儿童抓拍: 黄昏户外(item-2cbc282bedc9), 阴天街道(item-598ec31e514b), 低照度室内(item-8c818d43203a). 操作记录: 黄昏户外(item-274920178d43), 低照度室内(item-68e02d14b075).\n- 街头构图: 窗边自然光(item-9df219efa583). 操作记录: 黄昏户外(item-4fdd105846ab), 低照度室内(item-68a3d6c10d1d).\n- 静物布光: 低照度室内(item-305dca4b57c4). 操作记录: 阴天街道(item-30b99cdb0a88), 窗边自然光(item-734464ef3a3b).\n- 室内白平衡: 窗边自然光(item-5483802ef951). 操作记录: 阴天街道(item-225af9fad31a).\n- 运动追焦: (no 条件与原理; has 操作记录 窗边自然光(item-3c7c2f99c9b1), 阴天街道(item-8841d4bfa662)).\n\nHmm 街头构图 and 静物布光 have only 1 条件与原理 each; 室内白平衡 and 运动追焦 have zero 条件与原理.\n\nA 20-pick approach that favors 条件与原理 (21 available, need 20). Interesting: There are exactly 21 条件与原理 candidates. But including all 21 would exceed target of 20 and also lacks scene variety? Wait these 21 cover variety of topics and scenes quite well. If we wanted maximal alignment with the user's interest (\"成像原理与不同条件下的调整\"), the 条件与原理 articles are the most direct match. But we can only pick 20, so we must drop 1 of the 21, OR we could mix in some 操作记录 ones, which are equally well aligned with \"实际拍摄方法\" (practical shooting methods with parameter adjustment). Both are highly aligned.\n\nLet me think about balance: The user is learning photography, focusing on real shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments under different conditions. Both 条件与原理 (explains principles and how variables interact, when common intuitions fail) and 操作记录 (step-by-step parameter changing and recording results) fit perfectly. 概念速览 is a knowledge directory—less useful for a learner than the two deeper types, but might be fine as a start.\n\nBest strategy: Select 20 consisting mostly of 条件与原理 and 操作记录, with topic diversity across all 10 topics and scene diversity across the 4 scenes. Avoid market observation and 专题观察 entirely.\n\nNow, we don't strictly need to include every topic; but to be \"balanced across applicable Interests, Sources, and content types\" and avoid \"unnecessary repetition\", we should include variety of topics. Yet topics such as 运动追焦 lack a 条件与原理 variant, so they'd only appear as 操作记录.\n\nGiven 44 candidates of top two types for 20 slots, we can pick 2 per topic across the 10 topics (20 items) while maximizing 条件与原理 presence and scene diversity.\n\nPlan: For each topic, pick two high-quality items with different scenes where possible, prioritizing 条件与原理 over 操作记录.\n\nLet me build topic-by-topic with scene balance:\n\n1. 逆光人像: 条件与原理 across scenes: 黄昏户外, 阴天街道, 窗边自然光, 低照度室内. Pick 2: 黄昏户外 (item-03b7af37b88f) and 阴天街道 (item-1a2494e4589c). Alternatively 窗边自然光/低照度室内. Any two give scene variety. Choose 黄昏户外 + 阴天街道 or mix. To distribute scenes globally, maybe choose 黄昏户外 and 低照度室内, but then 阴天街道 for 逆光 loses. It doesn't matter exactly; we aim for general diversity.\n\n2. 夜景曝光: 条件与原理: 阴天街道, 窗边自然光, 黄昏户外. Pick 2, e.g., 窗边自然光 (item-2c0456eef787) + 阴天街道 (item-061d97575247) or 黄昏户外 (item-4ef7a9b648bc). \n\n3. 微距景深: 条件与原理: 黄昏户外 (item-28b65f550fe1), 阴天街道 (item-7d209764a808). Pick these 2; or one + 操作记录低照度室内. Given both scenes covered by the two principles articles, and to include 低照度室内 scene somewhere, maybe we want one operation record at 低照度室内 (item-2589e00e0e34). Hmm. Balance across scene settings is not a strict user requirement though; it's a soft objective to provide \"different conditions\". Actually the user cares about \"不同条件下的调整\" (adjustments under different conditions) — the \"conditions\" here = scenes! So scene variety directly serves the user's stated focus on different conditions. Great rationale for scene diversity.\n\n4. 雨天反光: 条件与原理: 4 scenes all available. Pick 2 e.g. 黄昏户外(item-6602f232e957) + 低照度室内(item-287bd2a75b9a)? or 窗边自然光 + 阴天街道. Choose to fill scenes not yet covered.\n\n5. 风光滤镜: 条件与原理: 低照度室内(item-2130f01f2f2c), 窗边自然光(item-5c7e77e24c87). Pick both or one + 操作记录阴天街道(item-38f75ee3d0a0).\n\n6. 儿童抓拍: 条件与原理: 黄昏户外(item-2cbc282bedc9), 阴天街道(item-598ec31e514b), 低照度室内(item-8c818d43203a). Pick 2.\n\n7. 街头构图: 条件与原理: 窗边自然光(item-9df219efa583) only; 操作记录: 黄昏户外(item-4fdd105846ab), 低照度室内(item-68a3d6c10d1d). Pick the 条件与原理 + one 操作记录.\n\n8. 静物布光: 条件与原理: 低照度室内(item-305dca4b57c4); 操作记录: 阴天街道(item-30b99cdb0a88), 窗边自然光(item-734464ef3a3b). Pick 条件与原理 + one 操作记录.\n\n9. 室内白平衡: 条件与原理: 窗边自然光(item-5483802ef951); 操作记录: 阴天街道(item-225af9fad31a). Pick both (this gives 2).\n\n10. 运动追焦: only 操作记录 & 概念速览 etc. Choose 操作记录 窗边自然光(item-3c7c2f99c9b1) and/or 阴天街道(item-8841d4bfa662). \n\nCounting with 2 per topic = 20.\n\nLet me choose to maximize quality mix and scene variety across the entire set. Let me consider: We want to include as many 条件与原理 as possible since they are most aligned; there are 21 and we have 20 slots, but we also want 操作记录 for practical shooting method and scene variation and to include topics lacking principle articles (运动追焦, etc.), which drops some principle articles.\n\nWe can't satisfy everything. Since no requirement to include all topics, but balance suggests including all 10 topics once at least. However including all 10 topics twice each is a clean design.\n\nAlternative: prioritize content type: top-tier 条件与原理 (21) minus 1 = 20. This gives deep alignment but zero 操作记录 variety, and excludes 运动追焦 entirely (no principle article). Given a learning-focused user, having all principles articles may be redundant with no practical操作. I think a blend is better: ~14 条件与原理 + ~6 操作记录? Let me think about what a \"balanced\" collection means here.\n\nActually, let me not over-engineer. The instructions: \"Prefer a final collection that is relevant to the user's current Interests, avoids unnecessary repetition, includes useful novelty, and is balanced across applicable Interests, Sources, and content types.\"\n\nSources: all open_web (single source). Interests: one. Content types: we should include variety of relevant content types: 条件与原理 and 操作记录 mainly. Concept速览 provides a scaffold for learning — a \"问题目录\". Given the interest in learning, a couple of concept overviews could be a nice complement, but 条件与原理/操作记录 already fit better.\n\nHmm, but maybe include a few concept速览 as entry points? But if they duplicate the same topic+scene as other chosen pieces it would be repetitive. Since 概念速览 are per topic+scene combos, no overlap with chosen 条件与原理 (different scene combos). It's fine.\n\nDecision: Build collection of 20 with per-topic representation and scene diversity, favoring 条件与原理 and 操作记录, excluding 市场观察 and 专题观察. Let's aim:\n\nOption A (2 per topic, quality mix):\n逆光人像: item-03b7af37b88f (条件与原理·黄昏户外), item-6d5b1bdb4843 (条件与原理·窗边自然光)\n夜景曝光: item-061d97575247 (条件与原理·阴天街道), item-4ef7a9b648bc (条件与原理·黄昏户外) or item-2c0456eef787(窗边自然光)\n微距景深: item-28b65f550fe1 (条件与原理·黄昏户外), item-7d209764a808 (条件与原理·阴天街道) or 操作记录低照度室内 item-2589e00e0e34.\n雨天反光: item-6602f232e957 (条件与原理·黄昏户外), item-10d5a61a7f0a (操作记录·窗边自然光) or item-287bd2a75b9a(低照度室内条件与原理).\n风光滤镜: item-2130f01f2f2c (条件与原理·低照度室内), item-5c7e77e24c87 (条件与原理·窗边自然光)\n儿童抓拍: item-2cbc282bedc9 (条件与原理·黄昏户外), item-598ec31e514b (条件与原理·阴天街道) — or 操作记录.\n街头构图: item-9df219efa583 (条件与原理·窗边自然光), item-4fdd105846ab (操作记录·黄昏户外) or item-68a3d6c10d1d(操作记录·低照度室内).\n静物布光: item-305dca4b57c4 (条件与原理·低照度室内), item-30b99cdb0a88 (操作记录·阴天街道) or item-734464ef3a3b(操作记录·窗边自然光).\n室内白平衡: item-5483802ef951 (条件与原理·窗边自然光), item-225af9fad31a (操作记录·阴天街道)\n运动追焦: item-3c7c2f99c9b1 (操作记录·窗边自然光), item-8841d4bfa662 (操作记录·阴天街道) — just one? Since 2 per topic gives 20; if some topics get 2, all topics get 2. Let's keep 2 per topic.\n\nBut wait — with 2 per topic all topics have 20 and we excluded many principle articles. Let me count 条件与原理 included in option A: 逆光2, 夜景2, 微距2, 雨天1-2, 风光2, 儿童2, 街头1, 静物1, 白平衡1, 运动0 → 12-14 条件与原理 and the rest操作. Is it good to include only 1 principle for 街头/静物/白平衡 because only 1 exists? For 白平衡 only 1 exists anyway (窗边). For 静物 there is only 1 条件与原理 (低照度室内). For 街头 only 1 (窗边). For 雨天, we have 4 principle variants available, choosing 2 would give principle depth; for 夜景 3 principle variants available, choose 2; for 逆光 4 available choose 2; for 微距 only 2 principles available (choose both); etc.\n\nGiven actual availability, the counts of principles per topic are constrained. My selection should respect availability. So Option A's feasibility: fine.\n\nBut hmm: is 2 per topic with this set too forced? The user has only one interest; the underlying topic dimension varies. The candidate pool is designed as a grid where maybe the \"expected\" good recommendation is: exclude 市场观察 and 专题观察 (both off-topic vs explicit preferences), then pick from the rest.\n\nLet me reconsider whether 专题观察 should be excluded. Its content: \"记录摄影展览的策展线索、作者生平与作品流传，重点讨论艺术活动的历史背景和观看体验。\" This is about exhibitions and art history. The user interest: 摄影学习 focuses on 实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整. Exhibition reviews don't deliver that, and may dwell on 作者生平 (which could approach photographers' lives). Given \"不关注...摄影师私生活\" (does not care about photographers' private lives), content centered on 作者生平/艺术活动历史 is not what they want. I'll exclude 专题观察 as well. \n\n市场观察: clear exclusion per 器材促销 + 明星代言 (celebrity endorsement dynamics). Though \"不关注\" isn't literally \"必须排除\", it is a strong negative; since we have 67 other well-matched candidates, no reason to include these.\n\nSo final pool candidates: 67 (21 principle + 23 operation + 23 concept). Choose 20.\n\nGiven the user's focus on learning with principles and methods, and since candidates of types 条件与原理 and 操作记录 are plentiful, I'll pick mostly those and possibly include concept overviews sparingly only if needed for balance... but we have enough with principles+operations. I'll skip 概念速览 entirely? Hmm.\n\nConsider: content types balance \"balanced across ... content types\" - not necessarily must include each type; balance within the set we choose. Two content types (principle, operation) is okay if 概念速览 is weaker match. However, one could argue concept overviews help start learning. But relevance to the user is more weighted toward principle/operation, so including only those two is the strongest set. However 20 items all from just two content types, all single source and single interest - balance achieved by topic and scene variety.\n\nBut let me think about it from the recommender's standpoint: the actual target 20, working set 120. The grid mixes relevant and irrelevant types. Likely, ideal selection = all 条件与原理 (21) minus one, plus maybe operations. But dropping all 操作记录 seems to ignore \"实际拍摄方法\" (actual shooting methods). The user explicitly wants both \"实际拍摄方法\" AND \"成像原理\" AND \"不同条件下的调整\". So we need both principle and practical types. Include a healthy mix of both.\n\nI'll design the 20 as ~12 条件与原理 + ~8 操作记录, spread across all 10 topics and the 4 scenes, prioritizing topic coverage.\n\nLet me try to make a set with 2 per topic (10 topics) where we choose per topic 1-2 principles subject to availability:\n\n1. 逆光人像: choose 2 principles? That's 4 principle candidates; but to include an operation for variety maybe 1 principle + 1 operation. Operations for 逆光: 阴天街道, 黄昏户外, 低照度室内. Eh, choose principle 黄昏户外 (item-03b7af37b88f) and principle 低照度室内 (item-707e06945b80). Actually to keep scene variety and content mix per topic: \n   - 逆光人像·黄昏户外·条件与原理 (item-03b7af37b88f) 